given-names>F</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Analyzing false memories in children with associative lists specific for their age</article-title><source>Child Dev</source><year>2007</year><volume>78</volume><fpage>1171</fpage><lpage>1185</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17650132</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Cavada</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Company</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Tejedor</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Cruz-Rizzolo</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Reinoso-Suarez</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The anatomical connections of the macaque monkey orbitofrontal cortex. A review</article-title><source>Cereb Cortex</source><year>2000</year><volume>10</volume><fpage>220</fpage><lpage>242</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10731218</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Chiu</surname><given-names>CY</given-names></name><name><surname>Schmithorst</surname><given-names>VJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Brown</surname><given-names>RD</given-names></name><name><surname>Holland</surname><given-names>SK</given-names></name><name><surname>Dunn</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Making memories: A cross-sectional investigation of episodic memory encoding in childhood using fMRI</article-title><source>Dev Neuropsychol</source><year>2006</year><volume>29</volume><fpage>321</fpage><lpage>340</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16515409</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Chou</surname><given-names>TL</given-names></name><name><surname>Booth</surname><given-names>JR</given-names